<title>USA: Foothill stake held by N.J. firm.</title>
<headline>Foothill stake held by N.J. firm.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basswood Partners L.P. said Monday it holds a 5.83 percent stake or 257,908 common shares in Foothill Independent Bancorp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Paramus, N.J.,-based firm said it bought the stake for $2.55 million and holds it for investment.</p>
<p>It said its latest transactions in the Glendora, Calif.,-based banking company include the purchase of 154,208 shares between December 1 and January 2 at prices ranging from $9.75 to $11.50 a share.</p>
